  "summary": [
    "C16 migrates exactly four X128/X139 helpers: two identical raw ambient-radius predicates and two existential minor-model predicates. The canonical composes upstream minor_rmap on the same map with the explicitly ambient, finitely truncated radius. Empty patterns and all existing branch requirements are retained.",
    "Ten current objects, six complete Original chain/row objects and one reused A7 count support four whole iff certificates. X128 keeps p->q->G,rho,t, natural weights and positive t; X139 remains blocked with its backward-ball defect. A7 partial bodies are preserved verbatim; complete Originals freeze both count and radius/model.",
    "Public corner evidence covers monotonicity, cutoff, empty branch/host/pattern, singleton and ordinary-minor consequences. The public-only client distinguishes ambient versus internal radius on a connected path6 branch with an outside universal host vertex."
